<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:sy="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/"><channel><title>修行分享 on 医行天下</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tags/%E4%BF%AE%E8%A1%8C%E5%88%86%E4%BA%AB/</link><description>Recent content in 修行分享 on 医行天下</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh</language><copyright>©2025, All Rights Reserved</copyright><lastBuildDate>Tue, 29 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tags/%E4%BF%AE%E8%A1%8C%E5%88%86%E4%BA%AB/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>最美相遇：3）大道至简</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%9C%80%E7%BE%8E%E7%9B%B8%E9%81%87-%E5%A4%A7%E9%81%93%E8%87%B3%E7%AE%80/</link><pubDate>Tue, 29 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Tue, 29 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%9C%80%E7%BE%8E%E7%9B%B8%E9%81%87-%E5%A4%A7%E9%81%93%E8%87%B3%E7%AE%80/</guid><description>最美相遇：1）健康是福 最美相遇：2）念恩报恩 8、根性·各不相同 末学跟妻子虽一起学修，但两个人根性完全不同。 末学偏向于净土宗根性，对念佛法门深</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%9c%80%e7%be%8e%e7%9b%b8%e9%81%87%20%e5%a4%a7%e9%81%93%e8%87%b3%e7%ae%80.assets/640-1754402775225-48.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>最美相遇：2）念恩报恩</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%9C%80%E7%BE%8E%E7%9B%B8%E9%81%87-%E5%BF%B5%E6%81%A9%E6%8A%A5%E6%81%A9/</link><pubDate>Fri, 18 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Fri, 18 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%9C%80%E7%BE%8E%E7%9B%B8%E9%81%87-%E5%BF%B5%E6%81%A9%E6%8A%A5%E6%81%A9/</guid><description>接上期： ✨最美相遇：1）健康是福 4、妻舅·不可思议 出殡那天早上阴雨天气，去殡仪馆的路上一直细雨蒙蒙。 火化时出来一看，天上突然现出了太阳，不断</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%9c%80%e7%be%8e%e7%9b%b8%e9%81%87%20%e5%bf%b5%e6%81%a9%e6%8a%a5%e6%81%a9.assets/640-1753277959904-70.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>茶话会：关于放下</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E8%8C%B6%E8%AF%9D%E4%BC%9A-%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8E%E6%94%BE%E4%B8%8B/</link><pubDate>Thu, 17 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Thu, 17 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E8%8C%B6%E8%AF%9D%E4%BC%9A-%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8E%E6%94%BE%E4%B8%8B/</guid><description>壹 安住 放下，这两个字听起来简单，其实蕴藏着对生活的深层理解。 放下不是放弃，也不是逃避。不是硬生生的丢掉什么，而是一种更清醒、更从容的生活态度</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%8c%b6%e8%af%9d%e4%bc%9a%20%e5%85%b3%e4%ba%8e%e6%94%be%e4%b8%8b.assets/640-1753276968281-1.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>最美相遇：1）健康是福</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%9C%80%E7%BE%8E%E7%9B%B8%E9%81%87-%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7%E6%98%AF%E7%A6%8F/</link><pubDate>Sun, 29 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sun, 29 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%9C%80%E7%BE%8E%E7%9B%B8%E9%81%87-%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7%E6%98%AF%E7%A6%8F/</guid><description>一、思索·一头雾水 一晃五旬已过，人生已过大半。无常随时到来，真是人生短暂。回想幼时，仿佛还在眼前。 自小受到家庭、学校教育，相信科学，不迷信。</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%9c%80%e7%be%8e%e7%9b%b8%e9%81%87%20%e5%81%a5%e5%ba%b7%e6%98%af%e7%a6%8f.assets/640-1751296578046-46.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>手机</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA/</link><pubDate>Wed, 04 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 04 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA/</guid><description>专心做一件事 老师的文章，需要多次拜读、体会、串习，每一阶段读的时候总会有不同的感触。 不知道为什么就到这样的状态，同年龄段的朋友，为了工作、事</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%89%8b%e6%9c%ba.assets/640-1749299288874-4.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>朝圣之旅</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%9C%9D%E5%9C%A3%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%85/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Fri, 30 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%9C%9D%E5%9C%A3%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%85/</guid><description>朝圣 一切都是 最好的安排 心心念念了好几年的朝圣，今年终于实现了，一切都是最好的安排。带上先生和女儿，踏上了多伦多这趟向往已久的旅程。 见识过新冠</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%9c%9d%e5%9c%a3%e4%b9%8b%e6%97%85.assets/640.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>放下</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%94%BE%E4%B8%8B/</link><pubDate>Tue, 20 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Tue, 20 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%94%BE%E4%B8%8B/</guid><description>老师开示完之后，最近几天反复地串习、思考，真正达到心静。 我觉得首先是放下。 这个放下，不是失败后的逃避，也不是消极的避世，不是自己口口声声的我</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%94%be%e4%b8%8b.assets/image-20250607090437195.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>千金难换</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E5%8D%83%E9%87%91%E9%9A%BE%E6%8D%A2/</link><pubDate>Wed, 07 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 07 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E5%8D%83%E9%87%91%E9%9A%BE%E6%8D%A2/</guid><description>在老师这里学修也有一年了，老师做了很多重要的开示，也指出了我们很多修行上存在的病。 末学是招招中招，实在是病得不轻，非常感恩老师的慈悲开示。老</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%8d%83%e9%87%91%e9%9a%be%e6%8d%a2.assets/image-20250513112009673.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>《归途》感悟</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%BD%92%E9%80%94-%E6%84%9F%E6%82%9F/</link><pubDate>Thu, 17 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Thu, 17 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%BD%92%E9%80%94-%E6%84%9F%E6%82%9F/</guid><description>归：首先用学到的来让自己认识、提升自己，明确归、找到归的内涵和方向。 途：也就是认识归、找到归的方向后，用学到的朝着正确的目标去。在途中有困难</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%bd%92%e9%80%94%20%e6%84%9f%e6%82%9f.assets/640.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>养生</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item><item><title>照自己</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E7%85%A7%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1/</link><pubDate>Sun, 22 Dec 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sun, 22 Dec 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E7%85%A7%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1/</guid><description>细细想来，有些“巧合”是不可思议的。 如果不是因为去年生了荨麻疹，不会接触到几位了不起的中医师。如果不是因为自己也生出一点感恩心，不会通过措阿</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e7%85%a7%e8%87%aa%e5%b7%b1.assets/image-20241222182319793.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item><item><title>一只手的故事</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E4%B8%80%E5%8F%AA%E6%89%8B%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B/</link><pubDate>Wed, 27 Nov 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 27 Nov 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E4%B8%80%E5%8F%AA%E6%89%8B%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B/</guid><description>“ 给师兄们分享从国内老义工师兄分享听来的《武汉一只手的故事》： 《一只手的故事》，2020年在武汉的义工，私下里拿了杨医生的药自己吃了发生的灵</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e4%b8%80%e5%8f%aa%e6%89%8b%e7%9a%84%e6%95%85%e4%ba%8b.assets/640.webp" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修心</category><category>修行分享</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category><category>健康素食 Plant-based Diet</category></item><item><title>原版《心经》</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%8E%9F%E7%89%88-%E5%BF%83%E7%BB%8F/</link><pubDate>Wed, 02 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 02 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%8E%9F%E7%89%88-%E5%BF%83%E7%BB%8F/</guid><description>原版 如是我闻： 一时，佛在王舍城耆阇崛山中，与大比丘众及菩萨众俱。时佛世尊即入三昧，名广大甚深。 尔时众中有菩萨摩诃萨，名观自在，行深般若波罗蜜</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%8e%9f%e7%89%88%20%e5%bf%83%e7%bb%8f.assets/640.webp" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>心经</category><category>修行分享</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item><item><title>孝亲报恩日·佛欢喜日</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%AD%9D%E4%BA%B2%E6%8A%A5%E6%81%A9%E6%97%A5-%E4%BD%9B%E6%AC%A2%E5%96%9C%E6%97%A5/</link><pubDate>Sun, 11 Aug 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sun, 11 Aug 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%AD%9D%E4%BA%B2%E6%8A%A5%E6%81%A9%E6%97%A5-%E4%BD%9B%E6%AC%A2%E5%96%9C%E6%97%A5/</guid><description>中元节，一个承载着深厚文化底蕴与浓厚情感色彩的传统节日，在中国民俗文化中占据着举足轻重的地位。中元节不仅融合了道教、佛教的信仰元素，还深刻体</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%ad%9d%e4%ba%b2%e6%8a%a5%e6%81%a9%e6%97%a5%20%e4%bd%9b%e6%ac%a2%e5%96%9c%e6%97%a5.assets/640.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修心</category><category>修行分享</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item><item><title>夏日小记 | 一场际遇</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%A4%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%B0%8F%E8%AE%B0-%E4%B8%80%E5%9C%BA%E9%99%85%E9%81%87/</link><pubDate>Sat, 20 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sat, 20 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%A4%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%B0%8F%E8%AE%B0-%E4%B8%80%E5%9C%BA%E9%99%85%E9%81%87/</guid><description>01 一切都过去了 大家都知道杨医生爱喝茶。多伦多的道友也都知道，杨医生每次泡茶用的水都是开车去郊外打的山泉水&amp;hellip;今日有幸和杨医生一起</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%a4%8f%e6%97%a5%e5%b0%8f%e8%ae%b0%20%e4%b8%80%e5%9c%ba%e9%99%85%e9%81%87.assets/640-1721835588333-49.webp" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>茶桌闲谈</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item><item><title>如是当下</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%A6%82%E6%98%AF%E5%BD%93%E4%B8%8B/</link><pubDate>Wed, 13 Mar 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 13 Mar 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%A6%82%E6%98%AF%E5%BD%93%E4%B8%8B/</guid><description>国外呆了很多年，我这个人特别懒得动。2019年也不知道哪根筋搭错了，屁颠屁颠地跑回中国，而且这一跑不得了。 从上海到成都然后藏地，又浙江 - 衢州</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%a6%82%e6%98%af%e5%bd%93%e4%b8%8b.assets/image-20240317112410137.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>茶桌闲谈</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item></channel></rss>